  unitName: High Dancer May
  unitId: 40041
  unitNumber: 62
  description: A beautiful dancer, extremely popular in the ruined Atharva Republic.
    She healed many with her magical demon dance. After the war with the gods began,
    she stood up to the gods as her dance could call forth thunder as well as heal.
    Her figure charmed many, and when she returned from battle injured, doctors from
    all over the country came to treat her.
  summonDesc: Look! Watch me dance!<br>Let me show you exactly<br>how much you need
    me!
  fusionDesc: I'm still not satisfied yet!<br>Lets keep on Dancing!
  evoDesc: So you don't think a<br>dancer can put up a fight!?<br>Go ahead, try me!
